// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P214147208" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of negative energy damage to {PlayerDest} and reduces their To Hit."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P386304613" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of negative energy damage and reduces your To Hit."
