// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1095808082" "Smite"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2906690495" "Melee, Moderate DMG (Smash/Negative), Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P2944253286" "You wrap your fists with Negative Energy channeled from the Netherworlds, then perform a Smite that deals more damage than Shadow Punch, but has a longer recharge time. Smite clouds the target's vision, lowering his chance to hit for a short time. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1038804902" "The Smite has reduced your Accuracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Maul 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3412974253" "Shadow Maul"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3836380500" "Melee (Cone), High DoT(Smash/Negative), Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3495200323" "You wrap your entire arms with Negative Energy channeled from the Netherworlds, then perform a series of blows that deal a lot of damage over a short period of time to multiple targets in front of you. These blows cloud your target's vision, lowering his chance to hit for a short time. Damage: High(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P569375037" "Your chance to hit has been reduced by the Shadow Maul."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P639036090" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with their {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Touch of Fear 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1744130983" "Touch of Fear"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P729486777" "Melee Fear, Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P922814186" "The Netherworld is one scary place, and with but a touch, you can give your enemy a glimpse into this dark world. This will cause them to helplessly tremble in Fear. Foes in this state of panic have reduced chance to hit. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1128528124" "Fear, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P793722308" "You are terrified and your chance to hit is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
