// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2721225545" "You shiver at {PlayerSource}s {PowerName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Siphon Life 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1123970646" "Siphon Life"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P220057402" "Melee, Superior DMG(Negative), Foe -To Hit, Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P4212877638" "You tap the power of the Netherworld and create a life transferring conduit between a foe and yourself. This will transfer Hit Points from your enemy to yourself. Foes Siphoned in this manner have their chance to hit reduced. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2987268302" "Your chance to hit has been reduced by the Siphon Life attack."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
