// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2196650277" "{PlayerSource} drains you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage to heal themselves and reduce your To Hit!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3467427143" "You gain {Damage} hit points from your {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
