"P2786855971" "Soul Drain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P617443402" "PBAoE Moderate DMG(Negative), Self +DMG, +To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P735107825" "Using this power, you can drain the essence of all nearby foes' souls, thus increasing your own strength. Each affected foe will lose some Hit Points and add to your Damage and chance to hit. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2439648564" "Your {PowerName} steals {Damage} points of life from the soul of {PlayerDest} to increase your power!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P571645819" "{PlayerSource} drains you for {Damage} points of Negative Energy damage to improve their Damage and To Hit!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Midnight Grasp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3103415061" "Midnight Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1020022634" "Melee, Superior DMG(Negative), Foe Immobilize, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1403688338" "Mastery over the forces of the Netherworld allows you to create dark tentacles that can Immobilize a foe and continuously drain his life force. Damage: Superior(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3411616425" "Immobilize, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1117666035" "The dark tentacles of the Midnight Grasp are holding you immobile.  Your chance to hit is reduced."
