// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P135684187" "{PlayerSource} smashes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P509105884" "Your {PowerName} smashes {PlayerDest} for an additional {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P132682522" "{PlayerSource} smashes you for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
