"P1083611728" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2384625231" "You smash {PlayerDest} with your mighty {PowerName} for an additional {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1226085207" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jacobs Ladder 
