// Power : Thunder Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1363030893" "Thunder Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2738002854" "Melee (AoE), High DMG(Smash, Energy), Foe Disorient, Knockback, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1320744260" "A massive attack. You smash your foes with all the power of a lightning bolt. The pummeled victim takes tremendous damage and may be Disoriented. Any nearby foes may be knocked down and take some damage from the shockwave as well as have some endurance drained. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
