// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3130787388" "{PlayerSource} pummels you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P713892034" "You disorient {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3202947871" "{PlayerSource} disorients you with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2330141365" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest} and drains some of their endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P741266314" "The explosion from {PlayerSource}'s Thunder Strike blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some of your endurance!""
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3440711165" "You have knocked {PlayerDest} off their feet with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3681708404" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you off your feet with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confront 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P556885240" "Challenges a foe to attack you. Useful to pull a villain off an ally who finds themselves in over their head. A To-Hit check required to Taunt enemy players, but is not needed against critter targets. Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chain Induction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1045457615" "Chain Induction"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2980306831" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe -End +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3841485922" "This Electric Melee attack deals moderate Smashing and Energy damage and may drain some of the targets Endurance. However, this attack also induces an unstable electric charge that may jump to another enemy target.  The charge will jump to the closest enemy in range that has not been previously hit, until it inevitably dissipates. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1988226113" "Charged"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1494527800" "You still carry a charge leftover from the Chain Induction punch.  You may accidentally release this charge and zap a nearby ally."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Clap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3403493376" "Lightning Clap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3753683648" "PBAoE, Foe Disorient, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P498129335" "You can clap your hands together to release a violent Lightning Clap. The Lightning Clap can knock down most nearby foes, Disorienting many of them. Lightning Clap deals no damage. Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1227518799" "The force of your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} disorienting them."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3110492796" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} disorienting you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Rod 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P775656620" "Lightning Rod"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P482008978" "PBAoE Superior DMG(Energy), Foe Knockback; Self Teleport;"
// Power Help Text :
"P4260412265" "You can polarize your body and become a living Lightning Rod. This power calls forth a massive lightning bolt from the sky to strike you. You can then ride this bolt and instantly Teleport a short distance. You rematerialize in a massive bolt of electricity, dealing massive damage and knocking down all nearby foes. Damage from the lightning bolt is superior. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
