"P3976048092" "Melee, Minor DMG(Fire)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1914384148" "This power engulfs your hands in flames, and can ignite the target of your Scorching attack. Once on fire, the target will suffer damage over time. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
