"P4084898314" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Psionic/Lethal), Foe -Rech, Self +Insight"
// Power Help Text :
"P3075613371" "You lash at your foe's mind with a mentally projected blade of psychic energy to deal moderate Psionic and Lethal damage. Affected foes will have their recharge rate reduced. Psi Blade has a moderate chance to grant you Insight. While you have Insight, Psi Blade will deal additional minor psionic damage over time. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
