"P3126601389" "Telekinetic Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2572009554" "Melee, High DMG(Psionic/Smash), Foe Knock Up, Self +Insight"
// Power Help Text :
"P3314143273" "You project telekinetic energy around your fist before delivering a shattering uppercut to your foe dealing high Psionic and Smashing damage and sending them flying into the air. Telekinetic Blow has a high chance of granting you Insight. While you have Insight, Telekinetic Blow will deal additional minor psionic damage over time. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
