"P1438624044" "Psi Blade Sweep"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1122717076" "Melee (Cone), High DMG(Psionic/Lethal), Foe Disorient, -Rech; Self +Insight"
// Power Help Text :
"P184422372" "You project a Psi Blade and swing it in a broad arc hitting all foes within a wide cone in front of you for high Psionic and Lethal damage. Foes struck by this power have their recharge reduced and have chance to become disoriented for a short time. Psi Blade Sweep has a high chance of granting you Insight. While you have Insight, Psi Blade Sweep will deal additional minor psionic damage over time and has a greater chance to disorient foes. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2112400848" "The Psi Blade Sweep has reduced your recharge rate."

