// Power Help Text :
"P2428396450" "You focus and create a more powerful Psi Blade projection before slashing at your foe to deal superior Psionic and Lethal damage. The affected foe will have their recharge reduced moderately and be left held for a short time. Greater Psi Blade will cause additional damage and cause this power's hold to last for a longer duration if you have Insight. Using this power removes Insight. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3873023144" "The Greater Psi Blade has reduced your recharge rate."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3941087674" "Your Insight is removed by Greater Psi Blade."
// DisplayFloat :
"P653056153" "Insight Strike!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1416744077" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P558192329" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mass Levitate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2337009411" "Mass Levitate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2948948823" "PBAoE, High DMG(Smash), Foe Knock Up, +Insight"
// Power Help Text :
"P1524408246" "You build up a large amount of telekinetic energy and release it causing nearby foes to be flung into the air. Affected foes will suffer high Smashing damage. If the caster has Insight when this power is used Mass Levitate will also cause a moderate amount of Psionic damage over time. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3352584451" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} and drop them to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3443579566" "{PlayerSource} lifts you and drops you to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Radiation Melee 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P410887822" "Radiation Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1053000728" "You are able to harness the power of Radiation to crush your foes in close quarters. Radiation Melee attacks have a chance to inflict the Contaminated state on a target for a moderate amount of time. Powers that deal greater damage, have a longer recharge time and animation time have a greater chance to inflict Contaminated. Hitting Contaminated targets with Contaminated Strike, Radioactive Smash, Radiation Siphon and Devastating Blow cause a portion of that power's damage to also hit nearby foes. Radiation Melee attacks primarily deal smashing and energy damage, but this set is also capable of dealing some toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Contaminated Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3425316208" "Contaminated Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P935921029" "Melee, Light DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe -Def, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2055256489" "You charge your fist with harmful radioactive particles and quickly strike your foe dealing Light Energy and Smashing damage as well as reducing their defense. Affected enemies have a small chance to be affected by the Contaminated effect. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3100956268" "-Def"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P69757552" "Your defense has been reduced by Contaminated Strike!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2901937396" "You clobber {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage and reduce their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2651285156" "{PlayerSource} clobbers you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage and reduces your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3450029796" "You contaminate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P903197212" "{PlayerSource} contaminates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1784745199" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of Energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3894123257" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with a {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of Energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P303727486" "You contaminate {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4180007661" "{PlayerSource} has contaminated you."
// DisplayFloat :
"P3342354899" "Contaminated!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P202536745" "You contaminate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2872487169" "{PlayerSource} contaminates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radioactive Smash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2055740106" "Radioactive Smash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4231564941" "Melee, High DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe -Def, Knockdown, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1706158143" "You channel a greater amount of radiation into your fists and deliver a hard hitting blow that deals Moderate Energy and Smashing damage to the target as well as reducing their Defense for a short time. Affected targets also have a chance to be knocked down and have a moderate chance to be affected by the Contaminated effect. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1550271624" "Your defense has been reduced by Radioactive Smash!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Proton Sweep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P912650439" "Proton Sweep"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3293273593" "Melee Cone, Moderate DoT(Energy/Toxic), Foe -Def, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3030517469" "You release a cloud of deadly radioactive particles in front of you inflicting Moderate Energy and Toxic damage over a short time as well as reducing the targets' defense. Affected enemies have a moderate chance to be affected by the Contaminated effect. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P461367302" "Your defense has been reduced by Proton Sweep!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1304172819" "You contaminate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Energy damage and reduce their defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3973393295" "You irradiate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1895849974" "{PlayerSource} irradiates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2843614669" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3676097179" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with a {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of Toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fusion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P789767047" "Fusion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P562858846" "Self +DMG, +To Hit, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4164867658" "Fusion boosts your damage and chance to hit moderately and also causes your next few attacks to have a 100% chance to inflict Contaminated on your enemies. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiation Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1724149063" "Radiation Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1188704680" "Melee, High DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe, -Def, -Contaminated, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2272596916" "You pummel your foe with a deadly smashing attack dealing High Energy and Smashing damage and reducing their defense. Hitting Contaminated targets will also heal you for a large amount of health over 3 seconds and remove the Contaminated effect from the target. However, uncontaminated targets have a moderate chance to be affected by the Contaminated effect. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: High Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3615033851" "Your defense has been reduced by Radiation Siphon!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1044716283" "Your absorb the radioactive contamination from {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P361883193" "{PlayerSource} draws the radioactive contamination from you to heal themselves."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3203057719" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} points of health."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confront 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Irradiated Ground 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2615246092" "Irradiated Ground"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2676578808" "Toggle, Minor DoT(Toxic) Patch, Foe -Def, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3424959268" "While active you will scorch the earth beneath you leaving toxic clouds of radioactive gas in your wake. Foes that enter these clouds will suffer Minor Toxic damage, have their defense reduced and also have a tiny chance of being Contaminated. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Devastating Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3020542785" "Devastating Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P979688142" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe -Def, Disorient, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2363053149" "You hammer your foe with a brutal smashing attack charged with a lethal dose of radiation. Your target will suffer Extreme Energy and Smashing damage, will have its defense reduced and will be disoriented for a short time. Devastating Blow has an increased change to critically hit.  Affected enemies will be affected by the Contaminated effect. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1877137739" "-Def, Disoriented"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Atom Smasher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1905585298" "Atom Smasher"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3804880963" "PBAoE, High DMG(Energy/Toxic), Foe -Def, Disorient, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1152672656" "You charge up a dangerously unstable amount of radioactive energy into a single fist before driving it into the ground and causing a small explosion. Foes caught in the blast will suffer High Energy and Toxic damage and have their defense reduced. Enemies also have a moderate chance to be disoriented for a short time. Affected enemies have a small chance to be affected by the Contaminated effect. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3783777" "Your defense has been reduced by Atom Smasher!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Savage Melee 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3710716733" "Savage Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1959150675" "Tear at your foes with deadly animalistic attacks that primarily inflict Lethal damage and cause additional damage over time.  Savage Strike, Maiming Slash, Vicious Slash and Savage Leap all grant stacks of Blood Frenzy.  Each stack of this buff grants a small damage buff and endurance cost discount.  You may have up to 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy active at a time.  Blood Frenzy can be maintained, or it can be consumed to empower Shred, Rending Flurry, Blood Thirst and Hemorrhage.  Using one of these consumers while you have 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy offers an additional benefit to these powers, but will also leave you Exhausted for a short time.  While Exhausted you cannot build Blood Frenzy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Savage Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4100731615" "Savage Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1182853694" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), Self +1 Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P1701320716" "You quickly tear at your foe dealing minor lethal damage and causing minor lethal damage over time. Savage Strikes grants you 1 stack of Blood Frenzy. Damage: Minor, Minor DoT, Recharge: Very Fast"
