// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shred 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1109597047" "Shred"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1204705949" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), -Def(All), Self -Blood Frenzy +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3241233476" "You rapidly slash at your foes several times causing a moderate amount of damage to all enemies in front of you and reduce their defense. Shred also causes minor lethal damage over time. This power consumes all stacks of Blood Frenzy and will deal slightly more damage per stack. Additionally, Shred has a 20% chance to immediately recharge itself for each stack of Blood Frenzy. Using this power with 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy causes you to become Exhausted for a short time. While exhausted you cannot gain Blood Frenzy. Damage: Moderate, Minor DoT, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P396928226" "-Def, Minor DoT(Lethal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2288190983" "Your defense has been reduced and you are bleeding."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4210179658" "You slash at {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2903778642" "{PlayerSource} slashes at your with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage and reduces  your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2432555977" "You are exhausted from using the {PowerName}!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P4236885904" "Exhausted!"

