// Power : Vicious Slash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1246734045" "Vicious Slash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P73812798" "Melee, High DMG(Lethal), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), Knockdown, Self +2 Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P522991178" "You tear at your foe with both hands dealing high lethal damage and causing minor lethal damage over time. Foes struck by this attack have a high chance to be knocked down. Vicious Slash grants 2 stacks of Blood Frenzy.  Damage: High, Minor DoT, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2663588066" "You gain 2 stacks of Blood Frenzy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Rending Flurry 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P858516965" "Rending Flurry"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4228970349" "PBAoE, Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), -Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P1444424222" "You wildly slash at nearby foes to deal moderate lethal damage and cause minor lethal damage over time. This power consumes all Blood Frenzy and will deal additional damage per stack of Blood Frenzy consumed. If you have 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy while activating this power, its radius is greatly increased, but causes you to become Exhausted for a short time. While exhausted you cannot gain Blood Frenzy. Damage: Moderate, Minor DoT, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confront 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blood Thirst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3105194080" "Blood Thirst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3966551164" "Self, +HP, +Health over Time, -Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P3560761146" "You focus for a moment and clear your head to take a moment to recover from your wounds. Blood Thirst will immediately heal you for a small amount and cause you to heal for a moderate amount of health over a short time seconds. Blood Thirst consumes all stacks of Blood Frenzy. This power's heal over time effect grows with each stack of Blood Frenzy. Using this power with 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy causes you to become Exhausted for a short time, but the duration of the heal over time effect is increased. While exhausted you cannot gain Blood Frenzy. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3830855541" "You take a moment to clear  your head and recover from your wounds."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1264138763" "Healing over Time"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2045207445" "You are recovering health over time due to your Blood Thirst."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hemorrhage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P723020678" "Hemorrhage"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2181602443" "Melee, Light DMG(Lethal), Foe Special DoT(Lethal), -Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P1346462429" "You viciously tear at your foe causing a light amount of lethal damage. Additionally, the target will suffer from lethal damage over time. Hemorrhage consumes all stacks of Blood Frenzy. This power's damage over time effect will scale with the number of stacks of Blood Frenzy. Using this power with 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy causes you to become Exhausted for a short time, but the duration of Hemorrhage's damage over time effect is increased. While exhausted you cannot gain Blood Frenzy. Damage: High, Special DoT, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1433672180" "Heavy DoT(Lethal)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Savage Leap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1339193839" "Savage Leap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P615360225" "PBAoE, Superior DMG(Lethal), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), +3 Blood Frenzy, Self Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P1921002539" "You throw yourself at your distant foes while slashing and tearing wildly dealing superior lethal damage and causing your foes to suffer from additional minor lethal damage over time. Savage Leap build 3 stacks of Blood Frenzy. Damage: Superior, Minor DoT, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P994619628" "You gain 3 stacks of Blood Frenzy!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Quills 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P401332978" "Spines"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3706486932" "Spines protrude from your body and can deal damage in melee or at very short ranges. Spines are hollow and hold a neural toxin that deals additional Toxic damage and can Slow or Immobilize your enemies. The toxin is cumulative, and multiple hits will affect a target more strongly.  Very few foes have resistance to Spine poison. Like all scrapper powers, all Spine attacks can sometimes land a critical hit for double damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Barb Swipe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P462935467" "Barb Swipe"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P229338810" "Melee, Light DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3989322711" "Shred your opponent with several quick Swipes from your Spines. Barb Swipe deals Light Lethal damage and a minor amount of additional Toxic damage over time and Slows affected foes. Damage: Light, Minor(DoT), Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
