"P3872693350" "Poison from your Spines deal {damage} points of Toxic damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2338297813" "You take {Damage} points of poison damage from {PlayerSource}'s Spines!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2397399910" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

