"P1391303782" "Lunge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P988536732" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P2002061440" "You can lunge forward, stabbing and poisoning a foe with the large Spine on your arm. Lunge deals moderate damage. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3655665276" "Your {PowerName} stabs {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
