// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Precise Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1562137608" "Precise Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562606845" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1810409765" "You attempt to daze your foe with a heavy staff blow  to their head.  Precise Strike has a higher chance to hit than normal,  deals Moderate Smashing damage, and has a small chance to disorient the  target briefly.   While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P703164344" "You strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4237552787" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Guarded Spin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P484186458" "Guarded Spin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P280558684" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG (Smash), Self +Def(Melee, Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1790322210" "You spin your staff like a propeller in front of you  dealing Light Smashing damage to enemies in your frontal arc and deflecting any incoming attacks, thus boosting your Melee and Lethal defense briefly.   While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2646575536" "+Def"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3381731766" "Your Guarded Spin has increased your defense moderately."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4218192560" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and boosts your own defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3090404567" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and bolsters their own defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Eye of the Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1480912102" "Eye of the Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3417303276" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Knockdown, Consumes Perfection"
// Power Help Text :
"P3255754516" "With a lightning fast series of spins of your staff you strike at all nearby foes dealing moderate damage with a chance of knocking foes down.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection if the user has two or less levels, if the user has three levels of Perfection it will consume them and gain some benefit.  3 Levels of Perfection of Body will cause additional smashing damage and reduce damage resistance slightly for a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Mind will cause additional psionic damage and reduce attack and movement speed for a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Soul will cause additional energy damage and reduce defense for a short time.  Critical Hit damage isn't enhanced by levels of Perfection.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2211841663" "Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P68898796" "Eye of the Storm has been empowered by the user's Perfection levels causing it to have lingering effects."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P292151044" "{PlayerSource} strikes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1388680925" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional smashing damage and reducing the target's damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1118979355" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional points of smashing damage and reducing your damage resistance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3589686291" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Mind causing {Damage} additional psionic damage and reducing the targets' attack speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P534912469" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Mind causing {Damage} additional points of psionic damage and reducing your attack speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3743526458" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Soul causing {Damage} additional energy damage and reducing the targets' defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P750178230" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Soul causing {Damage} additional points of energy damage and reducing your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Staff Mastery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3242442420" "Staff Mastery"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1239186492" "Change Stances/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1432415623" "By Purchasing this power, you will gain access to the following powers: Form of the Body, Form of the Mind and Form of the Soul.  Each of these toggle powers will allow the user to build up levels of Perfection, which grant the user a stacking short duration buff.  Each buff is unique to the active form, and only one form can be active at a time.  Perfection can be released by executing Eye of the Storm or Sky Splitter.  When either of these attacks are empowered with Perfection they will have additional effects that are unique to each form.  See Forms for additional details."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Form of the Body 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P323782650" "Form of the Body"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1897539723" "Toggle: Grants Perfection of Body levels"
// Power Help Text :
"P3657862115" "This power is obtained by purchasing Staff Mastery.  All Staff Fighting attacks will build a level of Perfection of Body while this toggle is active.  Each level will boost the user's damage output slightly.  Once the user has built up 3 levels of Perfection of Body and they execute Eye of the Storm, the attack will reduce the targets' damage resistance slightly and will deal additional smashing damage.  Executing Sky Splitter with three 3 levels of Perfection of Body will deal additional smashing damage and grant the user a moderate resistance buff for a short time.  Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Form of the Mind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3595267917" "Form of the Mind"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2641101422" "Toggle: Grants Perfection of Mind levels"
// Power Help Text :
"P2640629840" "This power is obtained by purchasing Staff Mastery.  All Staff Fighting attacks will build a level of Perfection of Mind while this toggle is active.  Each level will boost the user's recharge rate slightly.  Once the user has built up 3 levels of Perfection of Mind and they execute Eye of the Storm, the attack will slow the targets slightly and will deal additional psychic damage.  Executing Sky Splitter with three 3 levels of Perfection of Mind will deal additional psychic damage and grant the user a moderate to hit buff for a short time.  Recharge:  Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Form of the Soul 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3320672507" "Form of the Soul"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2441239293" "Toggle: Grants Perfection of Soul levels"
// Power Help Text :
"P1604693070" "This power is obtained by purchasing Staff Mastery.  All Staff Fighting attacks will build a level of Perfection of Soul while this toggle is active.  Each level will grant the user an Endurance Discount.  Once the user has built up 3 levels of Perfection of Soul and they execute Eye of the Storm, the attack will reduce targets' defense slightly and will deal additional energy damage.  Executing Sky Splitter with  three 3 levels of Perfection of Soul will deal additional energy damage and  grant the user a moderate regeneration and recovery buff for a short  time.  Recharge:  Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confront 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Serpents Reach 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3729913855" "Serpent's Reach"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2726034528" "Ranged, High Dmg(Smash), Foe Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P1856959131" "You fully extend your staff and release a burst of energy to lash out at a distant target and deal High Smashing damage with a good chance to knock your target down.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.  Damage: High, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Innocuous Strikes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2812989599" "Innocuous Strikes"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3554280595" "Melee Cone, High DMG(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P1913906050" "You repeatedly batter your foes' feet and legs with a flurry of sweeps of your staff.  This attack deals Moderate Smashing damage to all foes within its cone.  All affected targets will have their movement speed reduced, with a chance of being immobilized briefly.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P37065124" "-Speed"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1186580731" "Your movement speed has been reduced!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1733911188" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and slows their movement speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4059117771" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and slows your movement speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2541951899" "You attempt to immobilize {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1813956810" "{PlayerSource} attempts to immobilizes you with their {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sky Splitter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P110753208" "Sky Splitter"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2379474523" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Smash), Foe Knock Up, Disorient, -Fly, Consumes Perfection"
// Power Help Text :
"P2303602066" "You leap into the air and hammer your foe with an overhead bash from your staff.  Sky Splitter deals Extreme Smashing damage, will knock the target into the air and will briefly disorient your target.  While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection if the user has two or less levels, if the user has three levels of Perfection it will consume them and gain some benefit.  3 Levels of Perfection of Body will cause additional smashing damage and grant the user a bonus to damage resistance a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Mind will cause additional psionic damage and boost the user's chance to hit for a short time.  3 Levels of Perfection of Soul will cause additional energy damage and increase the user's regeneration and recovery rate briefly.  Critical Hit damage isn't enhanced by levels of Perfection.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1767117015" "You decimate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P79296238" "{PlayerSource} decimates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4041673568" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional smashing damage and boosting your damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P905210279" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional points of smashing damage and reducing their damage resistance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3827759647" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Mind causing {Damage} additional psionic damage and increases your chance to hit!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3012433311" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Mind causing {Damage} additional points of psionic damage and increases their chance to hit!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1702004300" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Soul causing {Damage} additional energy damage and boosting your regeneration and recovery rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P5020541" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Soul causing {Damage} additional points of energy damage and increases their regeneration and recovery rate!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1662970345" "Your {PowerName} drops {PlayerDest} from the skies."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brawling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2938953140" "Street Justice"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3810110994" "Street Justice delivers punishing bone crushing attacks that weaken, disable or otherwise hinder their foes. This melee power set has no singular form of secondary effect. Instead, it has many ways to cripple enemies. Street Justice's attack powers come in two categories: Combo Builders and Finishers. Combo Builders add to your Combo Level and thus empower any Finishers you use. See individual powers for how they're improved by Combo Level.  Combo Building powers can provide up to 3 levels of benefits. Build up to the third level before executing a Finisher for maximum effectiveness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Initial Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2767938832" "Initial Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4236187729" "Melee, Light DMG (Smash), Foe Disorient, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P2369376472" "You deliver a pair of lightning fast blows to your opponent in an effort to throw them off balance. Initial Strike deals Light Smashing damage and has a small chance to disorient your target. Initial Strike is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P580006646" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3886663292" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3602669381" "You boost your combo level to 1!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4254141574" "You boost your combo level to 2!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3834265031" "You boost your combo level to 3!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heavy Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1523772661" "Heavy Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3368222246" "Melee, Moderate DMG (Smash), Foe Knockdown, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P3737800714" "You strike your foe with a powerful punch dealing Moderate Smashing damage. Heavy Blow has a fair chance to knock the target off its feet.  Heavy Blow is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sweeping Cross 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P109148076" "Sweeping Cross"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2859779456" "Melee (Cone), High DMG (Smash), Foe Disorient, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P4037957082" "You execute a sweeping right hook that can strike multiple targets in your frontal arc. Sweeping Cross deals High Smashing damage and can disorient foes. Sweeping Cross is a Finisher and sets your current Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a greater chance to disorient dependent upon the current Combo Level. At Combo Level 3, Sweeping Cross will also have a chance to knock down the affected targets. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Combat Readiness 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2897233604" "Combat Readiness"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2390199633" "Self, +Dmg, +To Hit, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P362118892" "Activating this power will increase your chance to hit and the amount of damage you deal for a short amount of time as well as setting your current Combo Level to 3.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P647308172" "You prepare yourself to unleash a devastating attack on your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Throat Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2978963402" "Rib Cracker"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3272980502" "Melee, Moderate DMG (Smash), Foe -Res (All), -Dmg, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P1192951852" "You deftly strike your foe in a very vulnerable location. Rib Cracker deals Moderate Damage but reduces your foe's Damage and Resistance moderately for a short time. Rib Cracker is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2717042964" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage reducing their damage output and damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1350908225" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your damage and damage resistance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Confront 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spinning Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4288055952" "Spinning Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1836111938" "Melee (Targeted AoE), Heavy DMG (Smash), Foe Knockdown, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P4199344975" "You execute a spinning attack that first strikes with your fist and finally your heel hitting your foe and all enemies immediately nearby. Spinning Strike deals Heavy Smashing damage and has a high chance to knockdown foes. Spinning Strike is a Finisher and sets  your current Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a greater chance to knockdown dependent upon the current Combo Level. At Combo Level 3, Spinning Strike also has a moderate chance to briefly inflict Terrorize in nearby foes. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level.  Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P419999198" "Your {PowerName} crushes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3744035969" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2073040866" "You strike fear into {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2094263606" "{PlayerSource} strikes fear into you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Low Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1060578758" "Shin Breaker"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4142953630" "Melee, Superior DMG (Smash), Foe -Speed, -Defense, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P842572428" "You execute a quick but powerful kick targeting your foe's leg in an attempt to cripple their movement. Shin Breaker deals Superior Smashing damage and moderately reduces your target's movement speed and defense for a short time. Shin Breaker is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1900140634" "-SPD, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3556295630" "The Shin Breaker has reduced your movement speed as well as your defense."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1454251584" "You strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, slowing their movement rate and reducing their defenses!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P984764953" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, slowing your movement speed and reducing your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crushing Uppercut 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1268394429" "Crushing Uppercut"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P58316216" "Melee, Extreme DMG (Smash), Foe Knock Up, Disorient, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P2825194766" "You perform a jaw breaking Crushing Uppercut on your target inflicting Extreme Smashing damage and knocking them into the air. Crushing Uppercut will leave the target disoriented for a short time. Crushing Uppercut is a Finisher and will set your Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a longer disorient duration dependent upon the current Combo level. At Combo Level 3, Crushing Uppercut will have its disorient effect upgraded to a Hold effect. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Titan Weapons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1852466848" "Titan Weapons"
// DisplayHelp :
"P460724567" "You wield an over-sized weapon of some sort; a gigantic sword, mace or axe or possibly even a railroad crossing sign. The weapon's sheer mass gives it great destructive power, and your immense strength and skill allow you to use it as a devastating weapon. Titan Weapons as a set, has exceptional area of effect capability, while retaining a strong single target ability. Certain powers can only be used as follow up attacks and are grayed out when first entering combat, while others allow you to build up momentum and accelerate your attack speed for a few moments.  Momentum is gained by using a Titan Weapon power when you don't already have Momentum.  This effect lasts for 5 seconds.  Once Momentum wears off, another Titan Weapon attack must be used to grant Momentum again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Defensive Sweep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1426350644" "Defensive Sweep"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3522246723" "Melee(Cone), Light DMG(Smashing), Self +DEF(Melee, Smash)"
// Power Help Text :
"P198545772" "You take a defensive stance and strike your opponents.  Successfully executing this attack will cause light smashing damage to nearby foes, while giving you increased defense against their melee and smashing attacks.  Damage: Light, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2721162609" "Your Defense has been increased by your Defensive Sweep."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3007055125" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and increases your Defense to melee and smashing attacks!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P9067519" "You land a critical hit for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2211560513" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2796945418" "Momentum"

