// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3529617148" "Melee, High DMG(Smashing), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2515170223" "You swing a mighty crushing blow at your opponent dealing High Smashing damage and reducing their defense.  Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

