// Power : Follow Through 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2466830066" "Follow Through"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3456552698" "Melee, Superior DMG(Smashing), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), Knockdown, Stun, Requires Momentum"
// Power Help Text :
"P414355177" "You Follow Through with a massive attack dealing Superior Smashing damage, knocking your opponent down and possibly stunning them.  Additionally, Follow Through can cause the target to suffer a small amount of Lethal damage over time.  NOTE: Follow Through requires Momentum in order to be activated.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Long"
