"P2699767456" "Build Momentum"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P984588183" "Self +DMG, +To Hit, +Momentum"
// Power Help Text :
"P350158304" "Grants you momentum, moderately increases the amount of damage you deal for a few seconds and slightly increases your chance to hit.  Build Momentum grants you Momentum for 10 seconds and it replaces any remaining Momentum you may still have.  Recharge: Long"

