// Power Help Text :
"P333746249" "You perform a powerful Whirling Smash that deals Moderate Smashing damage, and can knock an opponent down.  Additionally, Whirling Smash can cause the target to suffer a small amount of Lethal damage over time.  NOTE: Whirling Smash requires Momentum in order to be activated.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
